{%- comment -%}
  SYNOR DIARIES — andar nu paanu (ek ahevaal).

  Listing shaant chhe (A-fine); aa paanu joordaar chhe. Chhapa pan e j kare
  chhe: pehlu paanu jaher ma bole, andar nu paanu vaanchvaanu hoy — pan
  ahiya ulto chhe, ane e jaani joine chhe. Karan: vaanchnar ahiya sudhi
  aavyo chhe, etle hve ene pakadi rakhvano chhe ane vechvanu chhe. Moto
  matthu, ghaatu chorasa, ane ₹49 sidhu najar ma.

  RANG = FRAGRANCE FAMILY. Kicker, drop cap, quote ane product chorasa —
  badha e j ek rang ma. Ek post = ek rang.

  TAGS:
    blog | vlog | review | letter   → upar no kind
    series-<slug>                   → series, ane niche "aa series ma"
    yt-<VIDEOID>                    → film (ek thi vadhare chalse)
    pick-<product-handle>           → niche product (max 6)
    family-* gender-* occasion-* brand-*  → niche na topics

  METAFIELDS (namespace `custom`):
    field_place · field_alt · field_temp · field_humidity · field_held · field_asked
    field_coords · youtube_ids · notes_top · notes_heart · notes_base · entry_no

  Badhu metafield khali hoy to e block aavto j nathi — guide post saaf rahe,
  vlog post ma aakhu field log dekhaay.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{%- assign sid = section.id -%}

{%- comment -%}
  FONT SET.

  Traan khana: dh = matthaa, d = lakhan, s = nanu uppercase sarjaam.
  Default 'now' e j Fraunces + Space Grotesk chhe, etle setting na badle
  paanu akshare akshar pehla jevu j dekhaay chhe.

  Aa badlaav fakt blog na paana ne j lage chhe: aa section potaano
  stylesheet jaate maange chhe, etle baaki no store adto nathi.

  font-synthesis-weight:none — jene 700 nu kharu akshar na hoy, e
  browser jaate jaadu kari aape chhe ane e kharaab dekhaay. Etle nahi.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign f_head = '"Fraunces",Georgia,serif'
  assign f_body = '"Fraunces",Georgia,serif'
  assign f_furn = '"Space Grotesk",system-ui,sans-serif'
  assign gf = 'family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght,SOFT,WONK@0,9..144,300..900,0..100,0..1;1,9..144,300..900,0..100,0..1&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700'

  case s.font_set
    when 'caslon'
      assign f_head = '"Libre Caslon Display",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_body = '"Libre Caslon Text",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_furn = '"Libre Franklin",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign gf = 'family=Libre+Caslon+Display&amp;family=Libre+Caslon+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&amp;family=Libre+Franklin:wght@400;500;600;700;800'
    when 'bodoni'
      assign f_head = '"Bodoni Moda",Didot,Georgia,serif'
      assign f_body = '"Bodoni Moda",Didot,Georgia,serif'
      assign f_furn = '"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign gf = 'family=Bodoni+Moda:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..96,400..900;1,6..96,400..900&amp;family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900'
    when 'newsreader'
      assign f_head = '"Newsreader",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_body = '"Newsreader",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_furn = '"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign gf = 'family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,200..800;1,6..72,200..800&amp;family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800'
    when 'instrument'
      assign f_head = '"Instrument Serif",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_body = '"Instrument Serif",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_furn = '"Inter Tight",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign gf = 'family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&amp;family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900'
    when 'tabloid'
      assign f_head = '"Anton",Impact,sans-serif'
      assign f_body = '"Newsreader",Georgia,serif'
      assign f_furn = '"Archivo",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign gf = 'family=Anton&amp;family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,200..800;1,6..72,200..800&amp;family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900'
    when 'bricolage'
      assign f_head = '"Bricolage Grotesque",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign f_body = '"Bricolage Grotesque",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign f_furn = '"Instrument Sans",system-ui,sans-serif'
      assign gf = 'family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,200..800&amp;family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700'
    when 'custom'
      assign gf = ''
      if s.cf_head != blank
        assign nh = s.cf_head | strip
        assign f_head = nh | prepend: '"' | append: '",Georgia,serif'
        assign gf = nh | replace: ' ', '+' | prepend: 'family='
      endif
      if s.cf_body != blank
        assign nb = s.cf_body | strip
        assign f_body = nb | prepend: '"' | append: '",Georgia,serif'
        assign one = nb | replace: ' ', '+' | prepend: 'family='
        if gf == ''
          assign gf = one
        else
          assign gf = gf | append: '&amp;' | append: one
        endif
      endif
      if s.cf_furn != blank
        assign nf = s.cf_furn | strip
        assign f_furn = nf | prepend: '"' | append: '",system-ui,sans-serif'
        assign one = nf | replace: ' ', '+' | prepend: 'family='
        if gf == ''
          assign gf = one
        else
          assign gf = gf | append: '&amp;' | append: one
        endif
      endif
      comment
        Koi pan khanu khali hoy to eno ghar no font joishe, etle e
        stylesheet pan maangvo pade.
      endcomment
      assign need_house = false
      if s.cf_head == blank or s.cf_body == blank or s.cf_furn == blank
        assign need_house = true
      endif
      if need_house
        if gf == ''
          assign gf = 'family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght,SOFT,WONK@0,9..144,300..900,0..100,0..1;1,9..144,300..900,0..100,0..1&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700'
        else
          assign gf = gf | append: '&amp;family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght,SOFT,WONK@0,9..144,300..900,0..100,0..1;1,9..144,300..900,0..100,0..1&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700'
        endif
      endif
  endcase
-%}

{%- liquid
  assign kind = ''
  assign series = ''
  assign famkey = ''
  assign yt_raw = ''
  assign pick_raw = ''
  assign topic_raw = ''

  for t in article.tags
    assign low = t | downcase

    if low == 'vlog' or low == 'blog' or low == 'review' or low == 'letter'
      assign kind = low
    endif

    assign h3 = low | slice: 0, 3
    if h3 == 'yt-'
      assign vid = t | slice: 3, 40
      assign yt_raw = yt_raw | append: ',' | append: vid
    endif

    assign h5 = low | slice: 0, 5
    if h5 == 'pick-'
      assign ph = low | slice: 5, 120
      assign pick_raw = pick_raw | append: ',' | append: ph
    endif

    assign h7 = low | slice: 0, 7
    if h7 == 'series-'
      assign series = low | slice: 7, 120
    elsif h7 == 'family-'
      if famkey == ''
        assign famkey = low | remove_first: 'family-'
      endif
      assign topic_raw = topic_raw | append: ',' | append: t
    endif

    assign h6 = low | slice: 0, 6
    assign h9 = low | slice: 0, 9
    if h6 == 'gender' or h6 == 'brand-' or h9 == 'occasion-'
      assign topic_raw = topic_raw | append: ',' | append: t
    endif
  endfor

  assign yts = yt_raw | remove_first: ',' | split: ','
  assign mf_yt = article.metafields.custom.youtube_ids.value
  if mf_yt != blank
    assign yts = mf_yt | replace: ' ', '' | split: ','
  endif
  assign lead_yt = yts | first

  assign picks = pick_raw | remove_first: ',' | split: ','
  assign topics = topic_raw | remove_first: ',' | split: ','

  assign fam = 'default'
  if famkey contains 'fresh' or famkey contains 'aquatic'
    assign fam = 'fresh'
  elsif famkey contains 'floral' or famkey contains 'fruity'
    assign fam = 'floral'
  elsif famkey contains 'woody' or famkey contains 'oud'
    assign fam = 'woody'
  elsif famkey contains 'amber' or famkey contains 'sweet'
    assign fam = 'amber'
  endif

  assign kl = s.word_blog
  if kind == 'vlog'
    assign kl = s.word_vlog
  elsif kind == 'review'
    assign kl = s.word_review
  elsif kind == 'letter'
    assign kl = s.word_letters
  endif

  assign words = article.content | strip_html | split: ' ' | size
  assign rt = words | divided_by: 200 | at_least: 1

  assign coords = article.metafields.custom.field_coords.value
  assign place = article.metafields.custom.field_place.value
  assign n_top = article.metafields.custom.notes_top.value
  assign n_heart = article.metafields.custom.notes_heart.value
  assign n_base = article.metafields.custom.notes_base.value

  assign no = article.metafields.custom.entry_no.value
  if no == blank
    assign found = false
    assign idx = 0
    for x in blog.articles limit: 60
      if x.handle == article.handle
        assign found = true
        assign idx = forloop.index0
      endif
    endfor
    if found
      assign no = blog.articles_count | minus: idx
    endif
  endif
  assign no_pad = no
  if no != blank
    if no < 10
      assign no_pad = no | prepend: '0'
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if gf != blank -%}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?{{ gf }}&amp;display=swap">
{%- endif -%}

{%- render 'sa-blog-seo', article: article, blog: blog, yt: lead_yt -%}

<article class="nd" data-fam="{{ fam }}">

  <div class="nd-strip">
    <span>{%- if no_pad != blank -%}{{ s.word_no }} {{ no_pad }}{%- endif -%}</span>
    <a href="{{ blog.url }}"><b>{{ s.paper_name | default: blog.title }}</b></a>
    <span>{{ s.ear_right }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="nd-rib">
    <span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>{{ kl }}{% if series != blank %} &middot; {{ series | replace: '-', ' ' }}{% endif %}</span>
    {%- if famkey != blank -%}<span>{{ famkey | replace: '-', ' & ' }}</span>{%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <header class="nd-head">
    {%- if coords != blank or place != blank -%}
      <span class="nd-kick">{{ coords | default: place }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <h1>{{ article.title }}</h1>
    {%- if article.excerpt != blank -%}
      <p class="nd-dek">{{ article.excerpt | strip_html }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </header>

  {%- if lead_yt != blank -%}
    {%- render 'sa-blog-video', id: lead_yt, title: article.title, credit: s.film_note -%}
  {%- elsif article.image -%}
    <figure class="ncut">
      {{ article.image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag:
           widths: '480,720,1000,1400', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 760px, 100vw',
           loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: article.title | escape }}
    </figure>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- render 'sa-blog-field', article: article -%}

  <p class="nd-byl">
    <time datetime="{{ article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">{{ article.published_at | date: s.date_long }}</time>
    <span>{{ rt }} {{ s.word_read }}</span>
    {%- if yts.size > 1 -%}<span>{{ yts.size }} {{ s.word_clips }}</span>{%- endif -%}
  </p>

  <div class="nd-body rte">
    {{ article.content }}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Vlog ma bija clip — ek trip na 3-4 video ek j ahevaal ma. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if yts.size > 1 -%}
    <section class="nd-reel">
      <h2 class="nd-h">{{ s.word_more_clips }}</h2>
      {%- for v in yts -%}
        {%- unless forloop.first -%}
          {%- render 'sa-blog-video', id: v, title: article.title -%}
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Notes — perfume ni khari bhasha: top, heart, base. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if n_top != blank or n_heart != blank or n_base != blank -%}
    <section class="nd-tbl">
      <p class="nd-tbl-h">{{ s.word_notes }}</p>
      {%- if n_top != blank -%}<div class="nd-tbl-r"><b>{{ s.word_top }}</b><span>{{ n_top }}</span></div>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if n_heart != blank -%}<div class="nd-tbl-r"><b>{{ s.word_heart }}</b><span>{{ n_heart }}</span></div>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if n_base != blank -%}<div class="nd-tbl-r"><b>{{ s.word_base }}</b><span>{{ n_base }}</span></div>{%- endif -%}
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} pick- tags → chhapa ni classified jem, ₹49 agal. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if picks.size > 0 -%}
    <section class="nd-ads">
      <h2 class="nd-h">{{ s.word_worn }}</h2>
      {%- if s.worn_note != blank -%}<p class="nd-ads-n">{{ s.worn_note }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- for h in picks limit: 6 -%}
        {%- assign p = all_products[h] -%}
        {%- render 'sa-blog-product', product: p, try_label: s.try_label -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if topics.size > 0 -%}
    <nav class="nd-top" aria-label="{{ s.word_topics | escape }}">
      <span>{{ s.word_topics }}</span>
      {%- for t in topics limit: 10 -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign lbl = t | downcase | remove_first: 'occasion-' | remove_first: 'family-'
          assign lbl = lbl | remove_first: 'gender-' | remove_first: 'brand-' | replace: '-', ' '
        -%}
        <a href="{{ blog.url }}/tagged/{{ t | handleize }}">{{ lbl }}</a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </nav>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.show_share -%}
    {%- assign a_url = request.origin | append: article.url -%}
    {%- assign a_txt = article.title | url_encode -%}
    <div class="nd-share">
      <span>{{ s.word_share }}</span>
      <a class="wa" href="https://wa.me/?text={{ a_txt }}%20{{ a_url | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">WhatsApp</a>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={{ a_url | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Facebook</a>
      <a href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url={{ a_url | url_encode }}&description={{ a_txt }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Pinterest</a>
      <button type="button" class="nd-copy" data-url="{{ a_url }}">{{ s.word_copy }}</button>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if s.show_house -%}
    <aside class="nd-house">
      <span class="m">{{ s.house_eyebrow }}</span>
      <b>{{ s.house_title }}</b>
      <p>{{ s.house_text }}</p>
      <a href="{{ s.house_link }}">{{ s.house_btn }}</a>
    </aside>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Aa series na bija ahevaal, pachhi baki na. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
  {%- capture also -%}
    {%- if series != blank -%}
      {%- assign ser_tag = 'series-' | append: series -%}
      {%- for a in blog.articles limit: 60 -%}
        {%- if a.handle != article.handle and shown < 4 -%}
          {%- assign hit = false -%}
          {%- for t in a.tags -%}
            {%- assign tl = t | downcase -%}
            {%- if tl == ser_tag -%}{%- assign hit = true -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- if hit -%}
            {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- render 'sa-blog-alsorow', a: a, blog: blog, s: s -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- for a in blog.articles limit: 20 -%}
      {%- if a.handle != article.handle and shown < 4 -%}
        {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- render 'sa-blog-alsorow', a: a, blog: blog, s: s -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign also_t = also | strip -%}
  {%- if also_t != blank -%}
    <section class="nd-also">
      <p class="nd-also-h">{{ s.word_also }}</p>
      {{ also }}
      <a class="nd-all" href="{{ blog.url }}">{{ s.word_index_link }}</a>
    </section>
  {%- endif -%}

  <p class="nd-folio">
    {{ s.paper_name | default: blog.title }}
    {%- if no_pad != blank %} &middot; {{ s.word_no }} {{ no_pad }}{% endif -%}
    &middot; {{ shop.domain }}
  </p>
</article>

<style>
#shopify-section-{{ sid }}{background:{{ s.paper }};
  --dh:{{ f_head }};--d:{{ f_body }};--s:{{ f_furn }};
  font-synthesis-weight:none}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd{font-family:var(--d);font-variation-settings:'opsz' 14;
  color:{{ s.ink }};max-width:{{ s.max }}px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 0 {{ s.pad_bottom }}px}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd *{box-sizing:border-box}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd[data-fam="fresh"]{--c:{{ s.c_fresh }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd[data-fam="floral"]{--c:{{ s.c_floral }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd[data-fam="woody"]{--c:{{ s.c_woody }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd[data-fam="amber"]{--c:{{ s.c_amber }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd[data-fam="default"]{--c:{{ s.gold }}}

/* ---- upar ni patti ---- */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-strip{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  gap:10px;padding:11px {{ s.gutter }}px;border-bottom:2px solid {{ s.ink }};
  font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.22em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.ink2 }};font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-strip a{text-decoration:none;color:{{ s.ink }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-strip b{font-family:var(--dh);
  font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 0,'WONK' 1,'opsz' 96;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-rib{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  gap:10px;padding:8px {{ s.gutter }}px;background:{{ s.ink }};color:{{ s.paper }};
  font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.22em;
  text-transform:uppercase}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-rib span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-rib i{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--c,{{ s.gold }});display:block;flex:none}

/* ---- matthu ---- */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-head{padding:20px {{ s.gutter }}px 0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-kick{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--s);
  font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.paper }};
  background:var(--c,{{ s.gold }});padding:4px 9px;font-weight:700;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-head h1{font-family:var(--dh);
  font-variation-settings:'SOFT' 0,'WONK' 1,'opsz' 144;font-size:{{ s.h1_m }}px;font-weight:900;
  line-height:.87;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:13px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.ink }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nd-dek{font-family:var(--d);
  font-variation-settings:'opsz' 24;font-size:15px;font-style:italic;line-height:1.45;
  color:{{ s.ink2 }};margin:14px 0 0}

/* ---- cut ---- */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut{position:relative;display:block;width:100%;
  margin:16px {{ s.gutter }}px 0;width:calc(100% - {{ s.gutter | times: 2 }}px);
  border:2px solid {{ s.ink }};background:{{ s.white }};overflow:hidden}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film{aspect-ratio:16/10;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-th{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film[data-on] .ncut-th,
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film[data-on] .ncut-go,
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film[data-on] .ncut-mark,
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film[data-on] .ncut-cr{display:none}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-go{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid {{ s.ink }};background:{{ s.paper }}ee;
  display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;padding:0;
  transition:background .2s ease,transform .2s ease}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film:hover .ncut-go{background:{{ s.ink }};transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1.05)}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-go svg{width:23px;height:23px;fill:{{ s.ink }};margin-left:2px;display:block}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-film:hover .ncut-go svg{fill:{{ s.paper }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-mark{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;
  font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.2em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.paper }};background:{{ s.ink }};padding:5px 9px;font-weight:700}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut-cr{position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;
  font-family:var(--s);font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.ink2 }};background:{{ s.paper }};padding:4px 8px}

/* ---- field log ---- */
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nfield{display:flex;margin:0 {{ s.gutter }}px;
  border:2px solid {{ s.ink }};font-family:var(--s);flex-wrap:wrap}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .ncut + .nfield{border-top:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nfield div{flex:1 1 33%;padding:8px 3px 9px;text-align:center;
  border-right:1px solid {{ s.rule }};border-top:1px solid {{ s.rule }};min-width:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nfield div:nth-child(-n+3){border-top:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nfield div:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .nfield b{display:block;font-size:6px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ s.soft }};font-weight:500}
